WEBVTT

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:10.425
Yes, what do you want, a cookie?
你要什么,饼干?

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.718
You did all right, man.
你做得很好.继续干活

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.052
Move on already.
你做得很好.继续干活

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.059
Yeah.
好!

00:00:22.395 --> 00:00:24.564
Vampire! Vampire!
-吸血鬼! -吸血鬼!

00:00:24.606 --> 00:00:25.940
A human.
人类!

00:00:28.735 --> 00:00:30.945
Who are you?
And how did you find this place?
你是谁?你怎样找到这里?

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:32.405
I'm Jonathan.
我是乔纳森.我和朋友爬山..

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.407
And I was just mountain
climbing with some dudes...
我是乔纳森.我和朋友爬山..

00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:38.077
...and heard this story about a spooky forest.
听说这个闹鬼森林

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:44.000
And who's not going to go
into a spooky forest, right?
谁能抗拒闹鬼森林,对吗?

00:00:46.127 --> 00:00:49.255
So, then I see
these goofy-looking dudes on fire.
然后我看到怪异的人着火

00:00:51.591 --> 00:00:55.762
And I just kind of followed them
to this, like, amazing castle.
我跟随他们来到这雄伟的城堡

00:00:57.597 --> 00:00:59.140
But, of course, be smart.
但是放聪明点.不要起火或燃放烟花

00:00:59.265 --> 00:01:02.268
No bonfires, no firework shows.
但是放聪明点.不要起火或燃放烟花

00:01:02.602 --> 00:01:04.979
-How many of you are there?
-Just me.
你们多少人?

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:06.314
I like to hit it alone.
只是我.我喜欢单身上路

00:01:06.439 --> 00:01:08.483
You meet so many awesome people
in the youth hostels.
你可以在青年旅馆认识很多很棒的人

00:01:08.608 --> 00:01:12.445
Hey, speaking of awesome,
that cape thing is killing it.
提到棒,你的斗篷帅呆了!

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.280
Is there, like, a costume party here?
这里有化妆舞会吗?

00:01:14.405 --> 00:01:15.490
What have I done?
我做了什么?全是我的错

00:01:15.615 --> 00:01:17.283
This is all my fault.
我做了什么?全是我的错

00:01:17.826 --> 00:01:19.160
You have to leave.
你必须离开

00:01:19.786 --> 00:01:21.287
-Oh, no.
-Excuse me.
糟了

00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:23.998
One of your piranhas in the lake is very rude.
对不起,你湖里的食人鱼很粗暴

00:01:24.123 --> 00:01:25.625
He ate my sister-in-law.
他吃了我的小姑

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.126
Be right with you.
我很快回来!

00:01:27.836 --> 00:01:30.839
Mr. Dracula, we asked for a room
with a view of the pool.
德古拉先生,我们说好要湖景的房

00:01:30.964 --> 00:01:32.799
The room's fine. We want to book a massage.
房间很好.我们要订按摩

00:01:32.924 --> 00:01:34.092
-Yes, Swedish.
-Shiatsu.
-瑞士式? -指压

00:01:34.133 --> 00:01:35.468
-Aromatherapy.
-Lower back.
-香薰? -腰部

00:01:35.593 --> 00:01:36.678
-Do you have hot-stone?
-We want a massage.
-我们不要热石头 -我们要按摩!

00:01:36.803 --> 00:01:38.471
-I'll get back to you, Mr. Hydraberg.
-I hope so.
-我很快回来,海德拉伯格先生 -我希望是

00:01:38.513 --> 00:01:39.848
-I doubt it.
-See that you do.
-我很快回来,海德拉伯格先生 -我希望是

00:01:39.973 --> 00:01:41.808
-That's Ms. Hydraberg.
-Thanks.
-确保你回来 -那是海德拉伯格小姐!

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.685
-Yes, nice to see you.
-Dude, seriously, what's up?
很高兴见到你们

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:45.478
It's kind of funky to breathe under here.
什么事?下面这里呼吸有点怪

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.147
Drac. Hey, Drac. How'd it go with Mavey?
德古拉!马维的事怎样?

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:50.525
Hey. Where'd you go?
嘿!你去哪里了?

00:01:53.027 --> 00:01:54.153
Wow!
哇!大城堡来说这房间算小了

00:01:54.195 --> 00:01:56.155
This room's kind of small for a big castle.
哇!大城堡来说这房间算小了

00:01:56.197 --> 00:01:59.117
No bed, but check out these
awesome dustpans they give you.
没床,但是看看这些畚箕

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.618
Quiet, you fool.
安静,笨蛋!

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.829
What weapons are you keeping
in this container?
你的容器里藏着什么武器?草叉?

00:02:02.954 --> 00:02:04.289
Your pitchforks?
你的容器里藏着什么武器?草叉?

00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:07.792
I can't breathe.
我不能呼吸!我要死了!

00:02:07.834 --> 00:02:09.335
It's killing me.
我不能呼吸!我要死了!

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.005
Yeah, definitely due for a fluff and fold.
是的,要换洗我的衣服了

00:02:12.046 --> 00:02:13.339
What is this?
这是什么?

00:02:13.464 --> 00:02:14.674
A torture device?
折磨仪器?神秘思想控制器?

00:02:14.716 --> 00:02:16.384
A secret mind controller?
折磨仪器?神秘思想控制器?

00:02:16.509 --> 00:02:18.344
You won't read my thoughts.
你不能读我的思想!我不会让你得手!

00:02:18.386 --> 00:02:19.637
I won't let you.
你不能读我的思想!我不会让你得手!

00:02:19.679 --> 00:02:21.306
Dude, it's just music.
朋友,只是音乐

00:02:21.347 --> 00:02:22.682
Here, try it.
来,试看!

00:02:25.727 --> 00:02:28.396
It's taking my soul!
它夺走我的灵魂!

00:02:29.564 --> 00:02:32.734
What? It's a good jam. Don't be a grandpa.
什么?这是首好歌.不要那么老土

00:02:32.859 --> 00:02:34.360
You need to go.
你必须离开

00:02:34.402 --> 00:02:39.324
No human has ever entered this castle.
And if someone should see you,
从来没有人类进来这城堡

00:02:39.365 --> 00:02:45.371
the safety of the hotel, the sanctuary,
no one would ever come again.
酒店的安全.庇护所!

00:02:45.413 --> 00:02:47.373
Yeah, go for it.
对,发泄出来!

00:02:47.498 --> 00:02:49.417
"Ever come again!"
永远不会再来!

00:02:49.542 --> 00:02:52.837
I love your Dracula voice. It's so over the top.
我喜欢你那德古拉嗓子!帅呆了

00:02:53.004 --> 00:02:57.592
And Mavis, if she saw you,
she would know that I lied. No!
马维丝.如果她看到你,她知道我说谎

00:02:57.717 --> 00:02:59.552
Who's Mavis? Is this her room?
谁是马维丝?这是她的房间吗?

00:02:59.677 --> 00:03:00.720
I'm good with a roommate.
我不介意室友.我有六兄弟,绝对可分享

00:03:00.845 --> 00:03:02.889
I had six brothers growing up,
so I could totally share.
我不介意室友.我有六兄弟,绝对可分享

00:03:03.014 --> 00:03:04.098
I can't kill him.
我不能杀他.这将令怪物倒退几百年

00:03:04.223 --> 00:03:06.392
It would set monsters back
hundreds of years.
我不能杀他.这将令怪物倒退几百年

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:08.102
One time, in Hamburg,
I roomed with this dude
有次在汉堡,我和一个偷我洗发液的人住

00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:09.729
who I caught stealing my shampoo.
有次在汉堡,我和一个偷我洗发液的人住

00:03:09.771 --> 00:03:13.066
I said, "Whoa, man," and he threw
a flower pot at me, but he was cool.
我喝止他,他把花瓶丢向我

00:03:13.107 --> 00:03:14.525
What are you babbling about?
你在胡说什么?

00:03:14.567 --> 00:03:16.069
What? Whoa.
哇,看看这些美丽的服装

00:03:16.194 --> 00:03:17.904
Check out these awesome costumes.
哇,看看这些美丽的服装

00:03:18.071 --> 00:03:19.656
Costumes.
服装!

00:03:20.406 --> 00:03:23.409
What's this? Sorry, man.
I just can't be without my backpack.
对不起,我不能没有背包.
我的一切都在里面

00:03:23.534 --> 00:03:26.037
-You know, everything I own's in there.
-It'll be right here.
对不起,我不能没有背包.
我的一切都在里面

00:03:26.079 --> 00:03:28.706
Okay, I just... I love my backpack.
好.我只是太爱我的背包

00:03:28.748 --> 00:03:30.249
Whoa. Hey, what are you doing?
哇!你干嘛?你对我的头发做了什么?

00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.377
What are you...
What are you doing to my hair?
哇!你干嘛?你对我的头发做了什么?

00:03:32.418 --> 00:03:34.921
Stop. Oh, wait, that tickles.
住手,很痒!

00:03:34.963 --> 00:03:37.215
Come on, man.

00:03:40.802 --> 00:03:42.887
Check it out. I'm a Franken-homie.
看,我是科学怪人的朋友

00:03:42.929 --> 00:03:44.764
-Yes, hello.
-Look at me!
-大家好 -看我!

00:03:44.806 --> 00:03:48.810
This is totally normal, not a problem here.
This is just a monster with me.
绝对正常,没问题.这是和我一起的怪物

00:03:48.935 --> 00:03:50.561
Man, everybody stepped it up tonight.
今晚大家都刻意打扮!

00:03:51.312 --> 00:03:54.399
Wait, why are we going to the front door?
Are we leaving?
等等,为何去前门?我们离开吗?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:56.567
Bonjour, Dracula!
你好,德古拉!

00:03:56.609 --> 00:03:58.403
Hey, Sniffy. What's going on?
嗅嗅,你好吗?

00:03:58.444 --> 00:04:00.279
Not right now, Quasimodo.
现在不行,卡西莫多

00:04:03.282 --> 00:04:04.701
What?
什么?

00:04:04.784 --> 00:04:06.077
No. Don't be absurd.
别开玩笑了.不是人类,是德古拉先生

00:04:06.119 --> 00:04:08.955
It's not a human, but Monsieur Dracula.
别开玩笑了.不是人类,是德古拉先生

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.082
How ridiculous. It's me.
真荒谬.是我

00:04:14.627 --> 00:04:17.171
-The devilled lizard fingers.
-Devilled lizard fingers?
釀蜥蜴指

00:04:17.296 --> 00:04:18.965
I asked for spleens-in-blankets.
釀蜥蜴指?我点的是脾脏卷

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:21.134
You ugly fool! I told you, he doesn't like
笨蛋!我说过他不喜欢釀蜥蜴指

00:04:21.175 --> 00:04:22.677
-the lizard fingers!
-But you said...
但是你说..

00:04:24.887 --> 00:04:27.098
Whoa. Check that costume out.
哇!看那服装!

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:31.477
Wow. Seriously, I just have to ask you:
How are you pulling this off?
我必须请教你.怎样做到的?

00:04:31.602 --> 00:04:33.104
I mean, it looks so real.
看来很真实.好像可以把手穿过..

00:04:33.146 --> 00:04:35.440
Like, I could just put
my hand right through...
看来很真实.好像可以把手穿过..

00:04:37.316 --> 00:04:38.484
What do you think you're doing?
你干嘛?

00:04:38.693 --> 00:04:41.654
She's real. You're real!
她是真的!你是真的!

00:04:41.821 --> 00:04:45.575
Yeah, and I'll give you a real beating.
Keep your hands out of my wife!
是!我真的打你!手远离我太太!

00:04:49.787 --> 00:04:50.997
Oh, no.
糟了

00:05:29.702 --> 00:05:31.370
Honey, I just didn't know where you were.
我不知道你在哪.还以为你还在外

00:05:31.496 --> 00:05:33.498
We thought you were still out.
我不知道你在哪.还以为你还在外

00:05:33.539 --> 00:05:36.167
Oh, no.
I don't know why I ever wanted to leave.
不.我知道为何我想离开.人类真闷

00:05:36.209 --> 00:05:38.169
The humans are so boring.
不.我知道为何我想离开.人类真闷

